## Implemented invariant

The authoritative phase-front path now projects exact per-output-vertex retained source charts and `HardRail` equivalence lineage into optimizer/final-validator authority.

Each output quad must resolve one unique exact chart side. Alternate chart use requires:

- exact retained chart membership;
- exact scalar source-entity support on the hard-rail route;
- matching explicit rail, route, and reciprocal front ownership;
