Scalar barycentric, position, component, sheet, and source-entity checks remain mandatory. Missing, misaligned, wrong-rail, wrong-route, nonreciprocal, unsupported, ambiguous, or disconnected authority fails closed. No global hard-feature union, proximity rule, source face-row order, numeric ID, count, frequency, or hash selects authority.

